{'symbol': 'SWK', 'date': '2022-03-14 09:02:00', 'title': 'THE BLACK+DECKER® DUSTBUSTER® ADVANCEDCLEAN™ SLIM CORDLESS HAND VACUUM SWEEPS UP A BETTER HOMES & GARDENS 2022 CLEAN HOUSE AWARD', 'text': 'TOWSON, MD., MARCH 14, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- BLACK+DECKER®, A STANLEY BLACK & DECKER BRAND (NYSE: SWK), ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS DUSTBUSTER® ADVANCEDCLEAN™ SLIM CORDLESS HAND VACUUM (HLVC315B10) HAS BEEN AWARDED BEST HAND VACUUM BY BETTER HOMES & GARDENS IN THE 2022 CLEAN HOUSE AWARDS.'}